  "translation": "This morning at ten o'clock, Xiaoming set off from home. He first went to a nearby supermarket. There were many goods in the supermarket. He walked to the fruit section and saw some apples. He liked apples very much. He asked the shop assistant: \"How much is this apple per jin?\" The shop assistant said: \"Five yuan per jin.\" Xiaoming said: \"I'll buy three.\" Then he also bought a cup of milk. He can pay with his phone. Finally he paid. After returning home, Mom was very happy. Xiaoming said: \"Today I bought apples and milk.\""
